rtas:<\/strong> Oficial Lap2Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida e Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 8 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:05<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Abertas:<\/strong> Oficial Lap2Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corridas Kids (Escal\u00f5es Jovens)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 8 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Jovens:<\/strong> Oficial Lap2Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Corre Jamor 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no <strong>Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor<\/strong>, em Oeiras (Lisboa).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas infantis iniciam-se \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h05<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado desenrola-se inteiramente pelo interior arborizado e pelas vias pavimentadas do complexo desportivo do Jamor.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Corre Jamor?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas t\u00eam direito a dorsal com chip de cronometragem, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, seguro, abastecimentos e medalha finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/corre-jamor-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lap2Go<\/a> e no site <a href=\"https:\/\/correjamor.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Corre Jamor<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corre Jamor 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor, Cruz Quebrada, Oeiras\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Oeiras\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Clube Ol\u00edmpico de Oeiras, CDNJ, CM Oeiras e HMS Sports\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Corre Jamor 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 8 de Novembro de 2026 , no Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor , em Oeiras (Lisboa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas infantis iniciam-se \u00e0s 09h00 , a Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 10h00 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10h05 .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 o percurso da corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado desenrola-se inteiramente pelo interior arborizado e pelas vias pavimentadas do complexo desportivo do Jamor.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Corre Jamor?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os atletas t